[scl-cln v1] itraces.cln
μ/meta: src:chat; date:2025-10-22; author:user+assistant; domain:itraces
χ/lang: en
φ/pol: noads; nocta; nofluff
σ/seq: ovr→cap→lim→how→ex→qa→ref→ctx
ovr: "Compact ops+debug guide for iTraces (backend+UI) in IDE/Heroku with anti‑hallucination."
ovr.scope: user_msg → POST /api/message → OpenAI Chat Completions; UI file: 'chatbot - Tests Interface.html'
cap:
 - LLM response (default model: gpt-4o-mini)
 - Retry w/ exponential backoff + jitter (max 5)
 - Errors 400/401/429/500/503 w/ JSON messages
 - UI overlay/spinner; input lock while processing
 - LocalStorage history w/ timestamps
 - Prod endpoint (Heroku) configurable in UI
lim:
 - must_not_invent: "If not in pack, answer: not provided."
 - scope_lock: "Answer only about this iTraces backend/UI case."
 - brand_names: "Only cite OpenAI, Heroku or items in ref.intg."
 - versions: "Do not infer versions; use literal values only."
how:
 step1: Set OPENAI_API_KEY (optional OPENAI_MODEL).
 step2: Backend: POST /api/message accepts {"message":"text"} or {"messages":[...]}; uses last item.
 step3: UI: set BACKEND_URL="https://itraces-backend-ca5e67d7785d.herokuapp.com/api/message".
 step4: While responding: UI disables textarea/button and shows spinner; re-enables on finish.
 step5: Network errors ECONNRESET/ETIMEDOUT/ENOTFOUND/ECONNABORTED → server returns 503 details.
 step6: No local FAQ; answers go straight to LLM.
ex.in: "What is iTraces?"
ex.out: "Intelligent customer‑service platform combining continuous learning and automation for contextual answers; it improves with use."
qa:
 1? What is the prod backend endpoint?
 1! https://itraces-backend-ca5e67d7785d.herokuapp.com/api/message
 2? Which AI model is default on server?
 2! gpt-4o-mini
 3? How does POST /api/message receive user text?
 3! Accepts {"message":"text"} or {"messages":[...]}; uses the last entry.
 4? What if message is empty?
 4! Returns 400 with error 'Mensagem não pode estar vazia.'
 5? Which network errors map to 503?
 5! ECONNRESET, ENOTFOUND, ETIMEDOUT, ECONNABORTED.
 6? How many retries to LLM?
 6! Up to 5 with exponential backoff + jitter.
 7? What is the LLM timeout?
 7! 30,000 ms.
 8? What to do for unconfirmed roadmap/prices?
 8! State validation is needed; do not invent info.
 9? What does the UI do while processing?
 9! Locks input, shows overlay/spinner, then unlocks.
 10? Where to set backend URL in UI?
 10! Constant BACKEND_URL in file "chatbot - Tests Interface.html".
 11? Is there a local FAQ?
 11! No; removed. Answers go straight to the AI API.
 12? Which lead fields to request (if interest)?
 12! Name, company, email, monthly volume, and current tools (CRM/help desk).
 13? How to contact human team?
 13! WhatsApp/Phone +55 48 99201-5911; email comercial@itraces.com.br.
 14? Key pillars to communicate?
 14! Dynamic learning; personalized support; intelligent automation; continuous evolution; simplified integration; data analysis.
 15? Behavior for info absent in this pack?
 15! Answer 'not provided' and avoid hallucination.
qa.n: 15
ref.intg: [OpenAI Chat Completions API; Heroku (backend deploy)]
ref.cmd: [curl -X POST "$BACKEND_URL" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"message":"Test"}'; set OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini  # optional; default is gpt-4o-mini]
ref.term: { BACKEND_URL: "HTTP endpoint for /api/message"; ECONNRESET: "Connection reset error"; Exponential backoff: "Increasing delay between retries"; Overlay: "Visual layer showing processing state" }
ref.fact:
 - openAIModel = process.env.OPENAI_MODEL || 'gpt-4o-mini'
 - 30s timeout on LLM call
 - Max retries: 5 with jitter
 - 401/429 handled explicitly
 - Local FAQ removed
 - UI stores history+timestamps in localStorage
ctx.flow: user_msg→/api/message→openai.chat; ui:file('chatbot - Tests Interface.html')
ctx.rules:
 - answer.empty → 400("Mensagem não pode estar vazia.")
 - net.err in {ECONNRESET,ENOTFOUND,ETIMEDOUT,ECONNABORTED} → 503(json)
 - missing_info → 'not provided'